NOTICE

@lamstack/react-dialog is a headless extraction and adaptation of MUI Toolpad Core's
`useDialogs` (https://mui.com/toolpad/core/react-use-dialogs/). The dialog stack
management in `src/dialog.provider.tsx` — the stack shape, the WeakMap-based
promise-to-entry lookup, the `requestDialog`/`closeDialog` functions, and the
two-phase close-then-unmount-after-delay behavior — is derived from Toolpad
Core's `DialogsProvider` implementation.

This package has no runtime dependency on MUI/Toolpad and contains no MUI code
verbatim, but the architecture above is substantially derived from it, so the
original license notice is reproduced below as required by its terms.

